Voyager is GNU GPL v3 (see LICENSE.md in the source tree). Original
authors: Oliver Wagner, David Gerber, and the VaporWare Voyager team.
Changes for release 3.5 by amigazen project.
The original authors are not affiliated with amigazen project.

Voyager V3 is dedicated to the memory of Oliver "Olli" Wagner.
